          "snippet": {
            "line": 344,
            "text": "theorem physical_moment_scaling {h τ : ℝ} (hh : 0 < h) (hh1 : h < 1 / 2)\n    (hτ : 0 < τ) (C : ℝ) (F : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ) (z : ℝ) :\n    renormalizedMoment (velocity h τ F) (referencePower h C) z =\n      Q h τ z ^ (1 - h) * profileMoment h C F (eta h τ z)"
